332
00:30:04,840 --> 00:30:08,140
Blood temperature seems like about high 80s, maybe.

333
00:30:08,220 --> 00:30:09,340
Wu?

334
00:30:09,430 --> 00:30:10,720
Ninety-one.

335
00:30:10,800 --> 00:30:14,100
Homoeothermic? It holds that temperature? Yes.

336
00:30:18,850 --> 00:30:21,610
But, again, how do you know they're all female?

337
00:30:21,690 --> 00:30:25,780
What, does somebody go out in the park and pull up the dinosaurs' skirts?

338
00:30:25,860 --> 00:30:29,320
We control their chromosomes. It's really not that difficult.

339
00:30:29,410 --> 00:30:31,990
All vertebrate embryos are inherently female, anyway.

340
00:30:32,080 --> 00:30:35,750
They just require an extra hormone given at the right developmental stage

341
00:30:35,830 --> 00:30:36,960
to make them male.

342
00:30:37,040 --> 00:30:39,920
We simply deny them that. Deny them that?

343
00:30:40,080 --> 00:30:43,710
