347
00:30:55,060 --> 00:30:57,770
but there it is.

348
00:30:59,310 --> 00:31:00,770
There it is.

349
00:31:01,350 --> 00:31:06,280
You're implying that a group composed entirely of female animals will breed?

350
00:31:06,360 --> 00:31:10,780
No, I'm simply saying that life finds a way.

351
00:31:17,950 --> 00:31:19,830
